{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430060/extras/b1de933a1714a8fc728fca795438a245.avif?t=1740709015\" width=600 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to Elon Musk's Brain-Computer Interface technology, perhaps we can upload our consciousness and become cyber beings when we age. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do the game characters we kill in games also possess their own cyber lives? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will killing them bring us cyber karma? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play cyber beads to eliminate game karma! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It will also bring you better luck and make it easier to obtain rare rewards in other games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430060/extras/78cdb15a0269add206df05c0449690cf.avif?t=1740709015\" width=600 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zen is the core resource in ZEN&amp;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more Zen you gain, the more you can change your mindset. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll witness the withering and flourishing of plants, the transformation of mountains and stones. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the end, you will find your inner peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430060/extras/b6d34c4d66a293186a0134b7a1fa9cbb.avif?t=1740709015\" width=600 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In China, people use plants beads to make mala. The\u00a0Chinese character \u4e32 means mala, because the beads strung together look like this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most buyers are not Buddhists, but buying to collect. The market size of prayer beads has reached at least billions of dollars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll become familiar with over ten materials for beads, such as moon and star beads, phoenix-eye beads, vajra beads, etc.(in the initial version, we'll only offer moon and star bodhi seeds). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, the time you spend on the beads will change the appearance of the beads from ordinary to jade-like, which the Chinese call Baojiang.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430060/extras/29d4eb092ecca566049a451c45ed8c43.avif?t=1740709015\" width=600 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This spiritual meditation is not boring or mechanical. We creat 300+ Zen stories in ZEN&amp;. Hope you like them.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3430060?t=1740709015","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430060/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740709015","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430060/73ec62ac76b2dfb0fa769f11146865f0952d11a4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740709015","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430060/73ec62ac76b2dfb0fa769f11146865f0952d11a4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740709015","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3485190,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430060/extras/b1de933a1714a8fc728fca795438a245.avif?t=1740709015\" width=600 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to Elon Musk's Brain-Computer Interface technology, perhaps we can upload our consciousness and become cyber beings when we age. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do the game characters we kill in games also possess their own cyber lives? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will killing them bring us cyber karma? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play cyber beads to eliminate game karma! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It will also bring you better luck and make it easier to obtain rare rewards in other games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430060/extras/78cdb15a0269add206df05c0449690cf.avif?t=1740709015\" width=600 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zen is the core resource in ZEN&amp;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more Zen you gain, the more you can change your mindset. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll witness the withering and flourishing of plants, the transformation of mountains and stones. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the end, you will find your inner peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430060/extras/b6d34c4d66a293186a0134b7a1fa9cbb.avif?t=1740709015\" width=600 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In China, people use plants beads to make mala. The\u00a0Chinese character \u4e32 means mala, because the beads strung together look like this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most buyers are not Buddhists, but buying to collect. The market size of prayer beads has reached at least billions of dollars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll become familiar with over ten materials for beads, such as moon and star beads, phoenix-eye beads, vajra beads, etc.(in the initial version, we'll only offer moon and star bodhi seeds). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, the time you spend on the beads will change the appearance of the beads from ordinary to jade-like, which the Chinese call Baojiang.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430060/extras/29d4eb092ecca566049a451c45ed8c43.avif?t=1740709015\" width=600 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This spiritual meditation is not boring or mechanical. We creat 300+ Zen stories in ZEN&amp;. Hope you like them.</p>","developers":["WHY LOGO"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430060/header.jpg?t=1740709015","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3430060/830947/1a38202dc3465411258eb3e70bbe0ffd72fb3c19/1750850196/dash_av1.mpd?t=1739860924","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3430060/830947/1a38202dc3465411258eb3e70bbe0ffd72fb3c19/1750850196/dash_h264.mpd?t=1739860924","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3430060/830947/1a38202dc3465411258eb3e70bbe0ffd72fb3c19/1750850196/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1739860924","id":257099558,"name":"Chuan DEMO PV","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257099558/3bc7447e3dba20e14bb5ea41ab708c6d530bf07d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1739860924"}],"name":"Zen&","package_g